b-lkp
B-Help
b-mark when lookup("b-mark", bttns) > 0
b-sel when lookup("b-sel", bttns) > 0
b-export when (v-cntxt-db-num = 0 and lookup("b-add", bttns) > 0)
WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
